<title>INDIA: India HPCL 1st half 96/97 net up 18.4 pct.</title>
<headline>India HPCL 1st half 96/97 net up 18.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     3,011.5    vs     2,543.3</p>
<p>    Net sales	     63,411.3    vs    52,888.2</p>
<p>    Other income	     612.4    vs	 405.3</p>
<p>    Expenditure	   57,287.5    vs    47,969.3</p>
<p>    Interest		   375.2    vs	 197.8</p>
<p>    Gross profit	   6,361.0    vs     5,126.4</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   1,605.5    vs     1,089.3</p>
<p>    Tax			1,744.0    vs     1,493.8</p>
<p>Note: State-run refiner Hindustan Petroleum Corporation Ltd (HPCL) said sales in the first half rose to 7.39 million tonnes from 6.82 million tonnes in the corresponding period last year.</p>
<p>--Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
